{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set sail for a world built for curiosity in Gecko Gods; a serene puzzle-adventure platformer where you explore a forgotten archipelago through the eyes of a tiny, but mighty, gecko.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb across sunlit ruins, weave through lush caves, and uncover the remnants of an ancient civilization, all at your own pace. With no wrong turns, every ledge, crevice, and hidden path invites discovery. Glide between islands on your small wooden boat, each stop offering new puzzles to solve, insects to snack on, and secrets to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793150/extras/GG-Storepage-gif-eatbug.gif?t=1749498176\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy exploring the water temple in the demo, before the journey comes to an end as you sail to the future islands available in the full game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3793150?t=1749498176","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3793150?t=1749498176","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793150/31c2dc3ca46561a761361e4e40f547a649f0b9b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749498176","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793150/31c2dc3ca46561a761361e4e40f547a649f0b9b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749498176","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set sail for a world built for curiosity in Gecko Gods; a serene puzzle-adventure platformer where you explore a forgotten archipelago through the eyes of a tiny, but mighty, gecko.</p><p class=\"bb_